WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.001
[Techno Music]

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.160
[Morris] Where do you see yourself in the&nbsp;
future? Because I'm telling you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.572
that, your future is here today!  

00:00:22.693 --> 00:00:31.280
[Brennan] I'm a nurse and an&nbsp;industrial engineer. Those two pieces come together&nbsp;&nbsp;because we focus on, as engineers, making&nbsp;the world better through technology&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:36.134
and as nurses, through using interpersonal and&nbsp;
medicine technologies to make people better.

00:00:49.493 --> 00:00:53.699
[Brutus] If you have a dream, you have to protect&nbsp;
it and don't let anybody ever take that&nbsp;dream away from you.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.080
And this really speaks to the&nbsp;importance of finding your why and understanding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:02.365
that your why will be your source of&nbsp;motivation every day and it's a long journey.

00:01:11.669 --> 00:01:16.000
[Akingbola] It is possible, even if you don't&nbsp;necessarily see it. I didn't see a black&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.880
physician growing up. Literally, we didn't have any&nbsp;
of my community, I didn't even have black teachers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.800
until medical school actually it was the&nbsp;
first time that happened for me. So, it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:30.640
is possible, even if you don't see somebody&nbsp;
who's representative of yourself in medicine.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:41.840
[Rodriguez] It's not just one person that will help&nbsp;
you get to where you want or need to go,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:47.360
it's a multitude of people or a village that will&nbsp;
help raise you into the person that you want to be.

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:54.403
[Perez-Stable] Remember to pay it forward, remember to be a mentor&nbsp;and be generous as you as you grow into into what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.478 --> 00:01:55.635
you want to do. &nbsp;

00:01:55.793 --> 00:01:57.506
[Holden] Our goal at mentoring and medicine&nbsp;

00:01:57.573 --> 00:02:07.840
is to help you become successful. The world is your&nbsp;stage, just keep asking questions keep being&nbsp;curious, and you will achieve your dreams.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:19.595
[Techno music swells]

